{"seq":1,"slug":"collaborative-filtering","title":"协同过滤","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/classic-methods/collaborative-filtering","wordCount":1783,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"协同过滤\">协同过滤</h1><p>协同过滤是推荐系统的「第一性原理」：它不看物品本身是什么，只看人们的集体行为，靠「和你相似的人喜欢什么」这一条朴素直觉就能跑出惊人效果。亚马逊那句著名的「买了这件商品的人还买了」，背后就是物品协同过滤。理解它，你就理解了整个领域为何能在对内容一无所知的情况下做出精准推荐——这也是它至今仍是无数系统主力的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>协同过滤的全部信息来自用户-物品交互矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{ui}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是用户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 对物品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的评分或行为。矩阵极度稀疏（通常 99% 以上为空），目标是用已知项预测空缺项。基于「拿什么算相似」，协同过滤分成两条经典路线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[用户-物品交互矩阵] --&gt; B{用谁的相似度}&#10;  B --&gt;|相似用户| C[基于用户 UserCF]&#10;  B --&gt;|相似物品| D[基于物品 ItemCF]&#10;  C --&gt; E[找口味相近的邻居]&#10;  D --&gt; F[找共现相似的物品]&#10;  E --&gt; G[用邻居评分加权预测]&#10;  F --&gt; H[用相似物品评分加权预测]&#10;  G --&gt; I[排序取 Top-N]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  A --&gt; J[稀疏/冷启动困境]&#10;  J --&gt; K[矩阵分解登场]\">flowchart TD\n  A[用户-物品交互矩阵] --&gt; B{用谁的相似度}\n  B --&gt;|相似用户| C[基于用户 UserCF]\n  B --&gt;|相似物品| D[基于物品 ItemCF]\n  C --&gt; E[找口味相近的邻居]\n  D --&gt; F[找共现相似的物品]\n  E --&gt; G[用邻居评分加权预测]\n  F --&gt; H[用相似物品评分加权预测]\n  G --&gt; I[排序取 Top-N]\n  H --&gt; I\n  A --&gt; J[稀疏/冷启动困境]\n  J --&gt; K[矩阵分解登场]</pre><p>两条路线在适用场景与工程性质上各有取舍，下表是选型时的核心依据：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>基于用户 UserCF</th>\n<th>基于物品 ItemCF</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相似度对象</td>\n<td>用户与用户</td>\n<td>物品与物品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直觉</td>\n<td>和你像的人喜欢的</td>\n<td>和你喜欢的物品像的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合场景</td>\n<td>用户少、社交属性强</td>\n<td>物品相对稳定、用户多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐解释</td>\n<td>「和你口味相似的人也看了」</td>\n<td>「因为你看过 X」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算稳定性</td>\n<td>用户兴趣易变，需频繁更新</td>\n<td>物品相似度相对稳定，可离线算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工业偏好</td>\n<td>较少</td>\n<td>主流（亚马逊、YouTube 早期）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"基于用户的协同过滤\">基于用户的协同过滤</h2><p>UserCF 的逻辑是：要预测用户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 对物品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的偏好，先找出与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 口味最相近的一批用户（邻居），再用这些邻居对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的评分加权平均。相似度常用余弦相似度或皮尔逊相关系数，后者会先减去各用户的平均分以消除「有人习惯打高分、有人习惯打低分」的尺度差异：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>u</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>u</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><msqrt><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>v</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sim}(u, v) = \\frac{\\sum_{i \\in I_{uv}} (R_{ui} - \\bar{R}_u)(R_{vi} - \\bar{R}_v)}{\\sqrt{\\sum (R_{ui} - \\bar{R}_u)^2}\\sqrt{\\sum (R_{vi} - \\bar{R}_v)^2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7399em;vertical-align:-1.13em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6099em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.14em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.97em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9301em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,1